{
  "version": 1,
  "_note": "关注列表:读 data.ps_list 的前 5 个包,按列表顺序显示各自近 7 天下载与较上周。⚠️ 刻意串行(每个包一条 op:if + request),见 slot_fetch。组件的流不做缓存(§5.5 契约 5)。",
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uY",
        "value": "亿"
      },
      "_note": "中文量级单位落成键再引用:表达式里不直接写汉字(与半角逗号混在一个串里,文案闸会误报)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uW",
        "value": "万"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lst",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "ps_list",
        "default": [
          {
            "e": "npm",
            "n": "react"
          },
          {
            "e": "pypi",
            "n": "requests"
          },
          {
            "e": "crates",
            "n": "serde"
          }
        ]
      },
      "_note": "关注列表由首页 / 管理页写进 data.ps_list,组件自己读 —— 用户在包里增删、调顺序,组件自动跟上,不用改组件参数。没存过时给三个知名包,首屏不空。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "屏障:data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnt",
        "value": "$[length::(${lst})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "e0",
        "value": "$[toLowerCase::(findNotEmpty::(${lst[0].e},npm))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n0",
        "value": "${lst[0].n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "has0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${n0}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isD0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${e0},docker),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isB0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${e0},brew),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isK0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${e0},cask),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isH0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isB0},1),1,if::(eq::(${isK0},1),1,0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isS0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isD0},1),0,if::(eq::(${isH0},1),0,1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${e0},crates),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${e0},pypi),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "m0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${has0},1),if::(eq::(${c0},1),0,if::(eq::(${y0},1),0,${isS0})),0)]"
      },
      "_note": "npm = 不是另外四个生态的一律按 npm。Docker / Homebrew 的名字绝不落到 npm 去查(nginx 在 npm 上也有同名包,会显示一份毫不相干的下载量)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nL0",
        "value": "$[toLowerCase::(${n0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dRepo0",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(split::(${nL0},/)),1),${nL0},connect::(library/,${nL0}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hT0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isK0},1),cask,formula)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rgCn",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,0)]"
      },
      "_note": "大陆(@app.region = cn)不提供 Docker Hub:hub.docker.com 在大陆打不开,发了也只会挂到超时。地区取不到(老宿主 / Win)为空 → 按海外照常取(与 stock 快讯、weather 的 nominatim 同一口径)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dOff0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isD0},1),${rgCn},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dGo0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isD0},1),if::(eq::(${rgCn},1),0,1),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${dGo0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rD0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/${dRepo0}/",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${isH0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rH0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://formulae.brew.sh/api/${hT0}/${nL0}.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${m0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rN0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.npmjs.org/downloads/range/last-month/${n0}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${y0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rP0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://pypistats.org/api/packages/$[toLowerCase::(${n0})]/overall",
            "method": "GET",
            "queryParams": {
              "mirrors": "false"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${c0}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rC0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/$[toLowerCase::(${n0})]/downloads",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable-pkgstats/1 (+https://numable.app)",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b0",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${y0},1),if::(gt::(length::(${rP0.data}),0),0,1),0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "sleep",
          "params": {
            "timestamp": "1500"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rP0",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://pypistats.org/api/packages/$[toLowerCase::(${n0})]/overall",
            "method": "GET",
            "queryParams": {
              "mirrors": "false"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "pypistats 偶发 429:隔 1.5 秒重试一次。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_c0",
        "value": "1"
      },
